SPARTA (27 Aug 2026)
Running on 4 MPI task(s)
################################################################################
# thermal gas in a 2d box with collisions
# particles reflect off global box boundaries
#
# collision partners selected randomly from entire grid cell (default)
#
# gas is Ar at 273.15 K with nrho = 5.65634e23 /m^3
# mean free path lambda ~ 2.4e-6 m, mean collision time tau ~ 6e-9 s
# grid cells are 1e-5 m ~ 4x lambda, coarser than the lambda/3 rule,
#   which is the regime where near-neighbor partner selection
#   (collide_modify partners nearcp or subcell) reduces the mean
#   collision separation
#
# Notes:
#  - the "comm/sort" option to the "global" command is used to match MPI runs
#  - the "twopass" option is used to match Kokkos runs
#  - the "comm/sort" and "twopass" options should not be used for production runs
################################################################################

seed               12345
dimension          2
global             gridcut 1.0e-5 comm/sort yes

boundary           rr rr p

create_box         0 0.0001 0 0.0001 -0.5 0.5
Created orthogonal box = (0 0 -0.5) to (0.0001 0.0001 0.5)
create_grid        10 10 1
WARNING: Could not acquire nearby ghost cells b/c grid partition is not clumped (/home/ci/w/C/src/grid.cpp:486)
Created 100 child grid cells
  CPU time = 0.00105021 secs
  create/ghost percent = 95.2279 4.77212

balance_grid       rcb part
Balance grid migrated 74 cells
  CPU time = 0.000410602 secs
  reassign/sort/migrate/ghost percent = 67.3518 0.291767 16.403 15.9534

species            ar.species Ar
mixture            air Ar vstream 0.0 0.0 0.0 temp 273.15

global             nrho 5.65634E23
global             fnum 5.65634E11

collide            vss air ar.vss

create_particles   air n 10000 twopass
Created 10000 particles
  CPU time = 0.00163844 secs

stats              100
compute            temp temp
stats_style        step cpu np nattempt ncoll c_temp

timestep           2.00E-9
run                1000
